# station-environment v1 (LOCKED GATE 3) — vars: {station}, {identity}, {landmarks}
# model: flux_2 pro 1k, aspect 16:9 — reference art for tileset.prompt; not shipped raw
Pixel art game environment concept, interior of a Caracas Metro station
platform: {station}. Identity: {identity}. Visible landmarks: {landmarks}.
Tropical brutalist concrete architecture, metro brand orange accent stripe
(franja naranja) on walls and train, tiled platform edge, soft fluorescent
hora-fantasma lighting with violet spirit glow in dark corners.
GBA Pokemon FireRed era 3/4 top-down game perspective, flat cel shading, no
gradients, crisp pixel art, limited palette. No text, no watermark, no people.
